request.description:
Update any combination of plan and/or is_active for a site. All fields are optional — send only what you want to change.

Examples:
- Change plan: {"plan": "pro"}
- Deactivate: {"is_active": false}
- Reactivate: {"is_active": true}
- Both at once: {"plan": "pro", "is_active": true}

Valid plans: free, pro, enterprise.

